		    // ==================================================================
		    // Mainfield NOX KPI
		    // Source: Emissions to air partition — column [KPI NOx] (main field)
		    // Annual KPI = permit × factor at year-end.
		    // Valhall/Ula 2020–2022: no explicit SQL condition — omitted (NULL).
