/// Historical sea discharge reference values — years 2019–2025.
/// Extracted from the Power Query if/then/else logic in Radioaktive isotoper
/// and the SQL CASE logic in Oily water.
/// Schema: (metric text, field text, year int64, value_permit_kpi number)
/// Enable Load = false — used only as a source by CombinedSeaRef.
/// 
/// Known limitations:
/// Ivar Aasen oily water metrics: NULL in legacy Oily water SQL due to a
/// field-name mapping bug (Field column maps 'PL 001B Ivar Aasen' → 'Ivar Aasen'
/// but the KPI/permit CASE conditions still reference 'PL 001B Ivar Aasen').
/// These rows are omitted to preserve the existing NULL behavior.
